  "description": "The Alfurnative was a furry convention held in Delft, Netherlands. It was created to host the first \"traditional\" style furry convention in the country, with a dealers' den, an event hall and a lounge. It was launched in May 2022 and held two editions at the Het Arsenaal hotel and outdoor venue, in September 2022 and September 2023. Its mascot was Vivienne the aardwolf.",
